<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia soymeal imports April 1-30.</title>
<headline>Indonesia soymeal imports April 1-30.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imports of soymeal through Belawan port in North Sumatra in February, 1997 based on data made available to Reuters by the port authority.</p>
